      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاتِبٌ</span></b>  <i>Being,</i> or <i>remaining, fixed, settled,</i> or
<i>firm: adhering, cleaving,</i> or <i>sticking:</i> (As, S:)
<i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَازِبٌ</span>. (Fr.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرْبَةُ لَاتِبٍ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضربة لَازبٍ</span>.
